  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "edgar-corpus",
  "description": "The dataset contains annual filings (10K) of all publicly traded firms from 1993-2020. The table data is stripped but all text is retained.\nThis dataset allows easy access to the EDGAR-CORPUS dataset based on the paper EDGAR-CORPUS: Billions of Tokens Make The World Go Round (See References in README.md for details).",
